//    rest of that document at all — it names rows in another table, not a
//    scalar or a small enum a client renders as a toggle.
// 2. `note_templates.is_archived`, reused per-caller. Rejected outright:
//    `is_archived` is a property of the TEMPLATE, shared by every user who
//    can see it (a built-in row is everyone's row), so "archived" can only
